        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.22529v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-24T17:59:22Z",
        "description": "LLM training is shifting from manual design and annotation to interaction-driven self-evolution. However, existing self-evolutionary methods face a fundamental dilemma between task diversity and verification reliability: environment-bound methods obtain precise feedback but confine learning to narro",
        "title_cn": "技能自我发挥：通过共同进化技能推动LLM能力的前沿"
      },
      {
