        "description": "The Integrated Sachs--Wolfe (ISW) effect probes the late-time evolution of gravitational potentials and provides a complementary test of the nature of dark energy. We investigate whether the redshift evolution of the ISW effect can provide new constraints on the time evolution of dark energy. We con",
        "title_cn": "通过集成Sachs-Wolfe效应使用Quaia类星体探测暗能量演化"
      },
      {
